{
  "slug": "context-vault",
  "name": "Context Vault",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Persistent structured memory for Claude Code. SQLite JSONB vault with 7 MCP tools for entity CRUD, todos with dependencies, and context injection across compactions.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills** and **1 command**.\n\n- **Skills** (2): `session-code` (Orchestration session dev : pick todo vault, decomposer en steps, coder, tester, archvet, deploy, smoke, step_done, next), `supervisor` (Superviseur de session multi-terminaux)\n- **Commands** (1): `note`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install context-vault@claude-community` from `hazyhaar/context-vault`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
